  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Field operations still matter in a digital Lagos workflow</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1092" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">A procurement-grade land platform for Lagos must continue working across inspections, corridor reviews, and evidence capture even when connectivity is unstable or work shifts away from the desk.</text>

  <shape id="shot-frame" type="rect" x="58" y="146" width="560" height="428" fill="paper" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1" shadow="true"/>
  <image id="shot" src="https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/i7Z8860JB409ZwkKDDtAu7/sandbox/slides_resource_ilxvirqgh4ifccy9plf8t-99b462a3-e2b-prod-us2_1784584125017_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2lkbHJfcHRzX21vYmlsZS9wcmVzZW50YXRpb25fYXNzZXRzL2ZpZWxkX3NlZWRlZF92MQ.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1786752000&__&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEYCIQCNDJ6tYeV63WIniRlseU4dNLpeCfFXTgn-9H9XaH3XTgIhALLljkfjfDUdhz9EqiryOaFttxiENwBBF~OpuWwpTqVF" x="74" y="170" width="528" height="380" fit="cover"/>
  <text id="shot-label" x="74" y="154" width="528" height="14" font="caption" size="11" color="muted" align="center" wrap="false">Real application screenshot • field mission workflow with low-connectivity, evidence, and sync-aware execution</text>

  <shape id="card1" type="rect" x="654" y="146" width="568" height="122" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card1t" x="680" y="170" width="516" height="76" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="primary">Offline continuity</strong></p><p space-before="10">Inspectors can continue parcel checks, evidence handling, and mission progression even when network quality drops, reducing disruption to service delivery.</p></text>

  <shape id="card2" type="rect" x="654" y="292" width="568" height="122" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card2t" x="680" y="316" width="516" height="76" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="primary">Evidence and corridor review</strong></p><p space-before="10">Field officers can collect and preserve proof tied to parcels, right-of-way checks, and development-sensitive corridors before escalation to desk reviewers.</p></text>

  <shape id="card3" type="rect" x="654" y="438" width="568" height="136" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="card3t" x="680" y="462" width="516" height="88" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p><strong color="primary">Replay, reconciliation, and trust</strong></p><p space-before="10">Queued field events, signed audit packages, and replay controls help Lagos maintain continuity between what happened on site and what later appears in the official record.</p></text>

  <text id="footer" x="58" y="686" width="620" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" wrap="false">IDLR-PTS Platform | Lagos State</text>
